## PO Line

One ordered line on a `PurchaseOrder`. Fields: `sku`, `qty` (thousandths of a unit, so `15880000` is 15,880 units) and `rateMinor` (cents per unit). The line's value is not stored: the purchase order's `orderedMinor` computes `rateMinor × qty ÷ 1000`, rounded, for each line.

The purchase order matches each line's `sku` against the lines of the bills linked to it to compute `lineStatus` (ordered versus received) and its `status`.

```ts
import { PoLine } from '@cardstack/catalog/cards/accounting/ledger-dimensions';

@field lines = containsMany(PoLine);
```

### Non-goals
No description, tax, discount or expected-date per line, and no currency other than the books' own.
